&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pine, we&#39;re on a mission to transform one of Canada&#39;s largest financial industries. Buying a home should be exciting - not stressful. That&#39;s why we&#39;re reinventing the mortgage experience from the ground up with intelligent technology, automation, and exceptional customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since launching, Pine has become one of Canada&#39;s fastest-growing fintech companies, managing billions in mortgage volume while building products that make home financing dramatically simpler, faster, and more transparent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to have been recognized as one of &lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&#39;s Top Startups in Canada for the past two consecutive years&lt;/strong&gt;, a reflection of both our rapid growth and the incredible team that&#39;s building the future of homeownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by some of North America&#39;s leading venture capital firms, we&#39;re building a world-class engineering organization that embraces innovation, ownership, and speed. We believe the best ideas can come from anyone, and we&#39;re looking for people who are excited to solve meaningful problems using modern technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Full Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a key role in designing, building, and scaling the technology powering Pine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across the entire product stack - from customer-facing experiences to the backend systems that power our platform - helping deliver products used by thousands of Canadians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our technology stack includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; React, Next.js, TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Kotlin, Postgres, AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern cloud infrastructure and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-powered tools and workflows integrated throughout our engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to work in a fast-moving startup where your contributions have an immediate impact on both the product and the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, and deploy high-quality full-stack applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop modern, responsive user experiences using &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable backend services and APIs using &lt;strong&gt;Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and Engineering to deliver exceptional customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical architecture, planning, and system design discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our shared component library and frontend architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, well-tested code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform thoughtful code reviews and mentor teammates through constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues and continuously improve application performance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape engineering best practices, tooling, and development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-assisted development tools to improve productivity while maintaining high engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore opportunities to incorporate AI-powered capabilities into our products and internal platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building modern web applications in a professional software engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;, JavaScript, and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing backend services with modern typed languages (Kotlin, Golang, C#, Java, Rust)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of API design, distributed systems, and scalable application architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Git, pull requests, and modern CI/CD workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, responsive design, and frontend performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for writing clean, maintainable, testable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated testing and quality assurance best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving abilities and a continuous improvement mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate across technical and non-technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile product teams and thriving in fast-paced startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI coding assistants such as Cursor, Claude Code, or Codex in software development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating Large Language Models (LLMs) or AI APIs into production applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building fintech or other highly regulated software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability, monitoring, and performance optimization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working at Pine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of &lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&#39;s Top Startups in Canada&lt;/strong&gt; for the second consecutive year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build products that are transforming one of Canada&#39;s largest industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with modern technologies and infrastructure including &lt;strong&gt;Next.js, Kotlin, AWS, GCP, and AI-powered development tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a highly talented and ambitious engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make meaningful technical decisions with significant ownership from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, equity, and comprehensive benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-performance culture that values curiosity, continuous learning, and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pine, we&#39;re committed to building an inclusive workplace where everyone can thrive. We know that diverse perspectives lead to better ideas, stronger teams, and more innovative products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applicants from all backgrounds, experiences, identities, and abilities. If you require accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process, please let your recruiter know - we&#39;re happy to work with you to ensure an accessible and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
